.TH LINAL 1 "October 2026" "linal 1.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
linal \- Signal messenger for the Librem 5
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B linal
[\fIURI\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Native GTK/libadwaita Signal client running as the primary Signal device via
signal-cli. Opening a \fBsignalcaptcha://\fR link continues registration; a
\fBlinal:conv/\fR or \fBlinal:call/\fR link (from a notification) opens
that conversation or call.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-mock
Run with canned demo data and no Signal account.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.local/share/linal/
Settings, and message history per account (\fBaccounts/\fR). Signing in with a
different account, or logging out, deletes every other account's history.
.TP
.I ~/.local/state/linal/logs/
Logs (phone numbers shortened, message text never logged).
.TP
.I ~/.local/share/signal-cli/
Signal account keys and data (signal-cli).
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR linal-receiver (1)
